#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <strong>Appointments</strong> app makes it easy for families to connect "
"with your team before committing to a camp. Whether they want to ask "
"questions, discuss special needs, or find the best fit for their child, this "
"tool helps you offer personalized service—without the back-and-forth of "
"scheduling emails."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija <strong>Termini</strong> družinam olajša stik z vašo ekipo, "
"preden se odločijo za tabor. Ne glede na to, ali želijo zastaviti vprašanja, "
"se pogovoriti o posebnih potrebah ali najti najboljšo možnost za svojega "
"otroka, vam to orodje pomaga ponuditi prilagojeno storitev – brez nenehnega "
"izmenjevanja e-poštnih sporočil glede razporejanja."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <strong>CRM</strong> app helps you manage every inquiry that comes "
"through your website's contact form—turning initial interest into confirmed "
"registrations. Whether it's a parent asking for more info, a school "
"proposing a group booking, or a returning family inquiring about "
"availability, the CRM keeps your sales pipeline organized and actionable."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija <strong>CRM</strong> vam pomaga upravljati vsako povpraševanje, "
"ki prispe prek kontaktnega obrazca na vašem spletnem mestu—ter začetno "
"zanimanje spremeni v potrjene prijave. Ne glede na to, ali gre za starša, ki "
"želi več informacij, šolo, ki predlaga skupinsko rezervacijo, ali družino, "
"ki se vrača in se zanima za razpoložljivost, CRM poskrbi, da je vaš prodajni "
"tok organiziran in omogoča učinkovito ukrepanje."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <strong>Events</strong> app is the heart of summer camp management. It "
"provides tools to create, customize, and manage all aspects of each camp "
"session."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija <strong>Dogodki</strong> je srce upravljanja poletnega tabora. "
"Ponuja orodja za ustvarjanje, prilagajanje in upravljanje vseh vidikov "
"vsakega termina tabora."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <strong>Projects</strong> app helps with behind-the-scenes preparation "
"and operational planning."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija <strong>Projekti</strong> pomaga pri pripravi v ozadju in "
"operativnem načrtovanju."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <strong>Sign</strong> app allows you to collect parental authorizations "
"quickly and securely through digital signatures. It's a reliable way to "
"ensure compliance while minimizing paperwork."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija <strong>Podpis</strong> vam omogoča hitro in varno zbiranje "
"soglasij staršev prek digitalnih podpisov. To je zanesljiv način za "
"zagotavljanje skladnosti ob hkratnem zmanjšanju količine papirologije."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <strong>Website</strong> app allows you to showcase your summer camps in "
"a visually appealing and informative way. It serves as the entry point for "
"parents and guardians to discover camp offerings, explore details, and "
"register children directly online."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija <strong>Spletno mesto</strong> vam omogoča, da svoje poletne "
"tabore predstavite na vizualno privlačen in informativen način. Služi kot "
"vstopna točka za starše in skrbnike, kjer lahko odkrijejo ponudbo taborov, "
"raziščejo podrobnosti in otroke neposredno prijavijo prek spleta."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bottom of the Email template contains an \"Attachments\" section. Here, "
"you can add files to send automatically with the template, such as a packing "
"list, more information, etc."
msgstr ""
"Na dnu predloge e-pošte je razdelek »Priloge«. Tukaj lahko dodate datoteke, "
"ki jih želite samodejno poslati skupaj s predlogo, kot so pakirni seznam, "
"dodatne informacije itd."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
